{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2023-01-17 10:00:00', 'title': 'SOLAREDGE BEGINS SHIPMENT OF NEW BATTERY CELL LINE FOR STATIONARY ENERGY STORAGE APPLICATIONS', 'text': 'MILPITAS, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (“SOLAREDGE” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: SEDG), A GLOBAL LEADER IN SMART ENERGY TECHNOLOGY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS ENERGY STORAGE DIVISION HAS BEGUN SHIPPING NEW BATTERY CELLS DESIGNED FOR STATIONARY ENERGY STORAGE APPLICATIONS.'}